Narita Taishin was very impressive.

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:50.910
Episode 8
\hA Small Wish

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.290
Impressive horse girls seem to be
 appearing in ever-greater numbers.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.770
Never mind that...

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.170
Ta-dah!

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:55.980
<b>Mejiro McQueen's Third Win Looking Likely
Takes the Osaka Hai</b>

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.980
This weekend is the Spring Tennoushou!

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.870
And Rice is all fired up about 
taking you down, McQueen!

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:00.440
Do your best!

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:02.650
Rice has you in her crosshairs, huh?

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:03.520
Yes.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:06.770
She's been following me around 
a fair bit lately, too.

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.120
That goes to show she's in serious mode.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:13.080
All the better. It'll make 
the challenge worthwhile.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:25.260
The Spring Tennoushou is 3,200 meters long.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:31.380
I'm good at long distances, 
but McQueen-san has won it twice already,

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:33.940
so she's got a clear experience advantage.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:36.930
McQueen-san...

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.720
Rice hasn't been coming to school?!

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.120
Not for the last two days, it seems.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.170
Do you suppose she's not 
going to be running?

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:06.160
No way! There's hardly any time 
left before the Tennoushou!

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:09.470
Maybe she's sick? Or she ate something funny?

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:10.030
Like a spider.

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:12.480
No one eats spiders!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.810
I wonder why she's missing, though.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.240
<b>Here</b>

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.240
<b>Tracen
 Academy</b>

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.240
<b>1-on-1</b>

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.240
<b>1-on-1</b>

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:41.290
Rice...

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:43.980
Bourbon-san...

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:01.480
How did you find me?

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:04.430
I spoke to the resident assistant,
 Hishi Amazon-san.

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:07.910
I didn't think you would leave 
without telling someone.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.260
I see.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.100
Mental strength...

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:21.180
I can't compare to McQueen-san in 
running ability or experience,

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.900
so I need to have a stronger mindset.

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:28.170
To do that, I decided to be alone, so I could
 face myself without any distractions.

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.640
I think that the mind can 
help the body transcend.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.520
The mind can push the body past its limits!

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:38.770
I agree.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:40.940
I'm going to get back to training.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.100
Right.

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:58.540
Sweets! Sweets! Sweets!

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.540
Rice still hasn't come back to school, huh?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.710
No. It's been three days now.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:05.010
Sweets! Sweets! Sweets!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.950
And Bourbon was missing too, today.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:06.870
Is it some kind of secret training,
 or has she given up?

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:10.510
Sweets! Sweets! Sweets!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:10.510
I don't think so! I saw 
how motivated she looked.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.850
52.9!

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:16.810
Wow!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.100
Looking good!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:20.800
Yes! I'm feeling more energetic and resilient

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:23.660
than I did in the previous two Tennoushous.

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:24.470
I see!

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:26.610
I'd like to run the incline again, please.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.290
Whoa, isn't twice enough?

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:30.990
Looking good and ready to go!

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.490
McNice! McNice!

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:43.000
<i>More... More... More...</i>

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:43.960
<i>More!</i>

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.430
Hey! What's up?

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.950
No, it's nothing!

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:57.370
What do you think's up with McQueen?

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:58.490
No clue.

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:01.680
But this attempt was even better 
than her last one.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:05.120
It's clear that McQueen is in
as good a shape as ever.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.260
Yeah, you're right.

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:18.410
G-Good question.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.630
Their final tuning is going very well.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:22.630
There's no way Machi Tan could ever lose!

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:25.040
She already beat Rice Shower once before!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.280
You do know she's beaten 
her more than once, right?

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.740
What, for real?!

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:35.500
'Kay, people, ask me anything about Palmer!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.930
As her certified bestie, I can tell you 
right now she's in GOAT condition!

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.430
Palmer FTW!

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.850
She's in really good shape.

00:07:45.850 --> 00:07:47.020
Yeah, it's impressive.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:49.490
I think we can count on 
McQueen's streak to continue.

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:52.300
Can she become the first to win
three Spring Tennoushous in a row?

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:55.140
I think so. In the condition 
she's in, she can handle it.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.360
Thank you!

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.230
Any concerns about Rice Shower?

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.370
She's apparently been absent 
from school for a few days.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.200
Not concerned at all.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:05.880
No matter who she's up against, 
McQueen is focused on her own running.

